   "source": [
    "# GC: Subject 15 — Completion Run\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook ini **khusus** untuk memproses Subject 15 yang terlewat di notebook GC utama.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Status sebelum run:\n",
    "- ❌ **GC**: Subject 15 = 0/45 trial (tidak ada sama sekali)\n",
    "- ✅ **PDC**: Subject 15 = 45/45 trial (sudah selesai)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Apa yang dilakukan notebook ini:\n",
    "1. Memproses 45 trial Subject 15 (3 sesi × 15 trial)\n",
    "2. Menyimpan hasil ke folder output GC yang sama (`gc_matrices/subject_15/`)\n",
    "3. Memperbarui `gc_metadata.json` agar mencakup semua 15 subjek (total 675 trial)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Estimasi waktu:\n",
    "- ~1400–1900 detik per trial\n",
    "- 45 trial × ~1600 detik ≈ **~20 jam**\n",
    "- ⚠️ Jalankan overnight atau pastikan tidak ada interruption\n",
    "\n",
    "## Parameter (sama dengan notebook utama):\n",
    "- Lag range: 2–5 (AIC optimal per pair)\n",
    "- Threshold: Proportional top 10%\n",
    "- Skip: Otomatis jika file output sudah ada"
   ]
  },
  {
